<section class="page-hero shell compact"><p class="kicker">Privacy & personalisation</p><h1>Your browsing preferences.</h1><p>Essential storefront functions do not require behavioural profiling. You can review, reset, export or delete this browser's anonymous shopping profile at any time.</p></section>
<section class="section shell si-privacy-page" data-si-privacy-page><div class="admin-grid two"><section class="admin-card"><h2>Current browser profile</h2><p data-si-profile-status>Checking anonymous profile…</p><div class="inline-actions"><button class="btn outline" type="button" data-si-export>Export data</button><button class="btn outline" type="button" data-si-reset>Reset interests</button><button class="btn outline" type="button" data-si-disable>Disable personalisation</button><button class="btn danger" type="button" data-si-delete>Delete profile</button></div></section><section class="admin-card"><h2>What the system does not need</h2><p>Anonymous shopping intelligence does not require your name, email, mobile number, address or social-media identity. Sensitive personal characteristics are not used to create recommendation segments.</p><p>Removing or disabling this profile does not prevent normal catalogue browsing, cart use or checkout.</p></section></div></section>
